  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender-GAP - Gender Action Plan - Doing Business - Gender</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gender-GAP - Gender Action Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Doing Business - Gender is part of the World Bank Gender Action Plan (GAP) and its initiative &quot;Gender equality as smart economics&quot;. Its purpose is to identify obstacles that discriminate against women&#xB4;s economic opportunities, while identifying and suggesting reforms that have benefits for women. /dkelleci 2009.11.09</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Doing Business - Gender &#xE4;r en del av V&#xE4;rldbankens Gender Action Plan (GAP) och dess initiativ Gender equality as smart economics. Dess syfte &#xE4;r att identifiera diskriminering vad g&#xE4;ller kvinnors  ekonomiska utveckling, samtidigt som reformer identifieras och f&#xF6;resl&#xE5;s f&#xF6;r att &#xE5;stadkomma nytta f&#xF6;r kvinnor. /dkelleci 2009.11.09</narrative>
  </description>
